• RoHS certified :This module is RoHS certified, ensuring that it meets high safety and environmental standards.



GIRIER Tuya ZigBee Curtain Switch Module

Main Features:

Intelligent Remote Control:Remote control your curtain from anywhere via TuyaSmart/Smart Life app.

Compatible with Alexa/Hey Google: Easily turn on/off the curtain switch with simple voice commands by Alexa/Google Home Assistant.

Flexible Timer Function: Timer can be easily set to open/close the blinds curtain switch.

ZigBee 3.0 Protocol: Make your smart curtain system more stable and safer.
