When I set the Moes GU10 RGB spot to color mode, most of the time nothing happens.
The RGB color does not work, but when I choose a color between 3000k and 6500k it does work.


Steps to reproduce the behavior:
1. Go to 'app'
2. (long) Click on 'the light spot (bulb)'
3. Scroll down to 'colour'
4. select a color (RGB) nothing happens and no error report appears.

A clear and concise description of what you expected to happen.
I expect the color of the spot would change.
Unfortunately, this is not the case with RGB.
Warm and cold white light works well with this.

**App and Homey version**
What Homey version are you running? 10.0.4
What version of Homey firmware do you use? 7.5.3.1395 (APP)
What version of the Tuya Zigbee App are you using? v0.1.45


