Different Lamps (shape) from the same Track-System:

https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005005362802827.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.main.43.54c1SYwbSYwbZf&algo_pvid=0672db19-e44d-4009-84ce-f34c6b90a3ab&algo_exp_id=0672db19-e44d-4009-84ce-f34c6b90a3ab-21&pdp_npi=4%40dis%21CHF%2158.13%2129.06%21%21%2162.07%21%21%402103255a16963417337087770ee941%2112000032788662083%21sea%21CH%210%21AB&curPageLogUid=hNr45bl2M0ut

They work more or less, but in the Tuya app (with Zenismart Homekit Hub) there is the possibility to set the dimming time (for example smooth turning on/off takes 1 second or 5 seconds, can be set in 0.2 second steps). It would be nice to have that option too, as the standard is 5 seconds which is really slow to turn it on.

Also there is the Possibility to set how they should behave after a Poweroutage (On/Off/Recover last State). This is very useful too :)

